OL,3,GNEWSAArtist honoured her surgeon with
OL,4,Ahis portrait
OL,5,
OL,6,FA surgeon who celebrates 40 years of
OL,7,Fhis career says he had been "touched"
OL,8,Fto have a portrait painted by a former
OL,9,Fpatient.
OL,11,FOxford-based artist Ruth Swain was 50
OL,12,Fwhen diagnosed with breast cancer in
OL,13,F2012 and was referred to Dr Gerald Gui
OL,14,Fat the Royal Marsden Hospital in
OL,15,FLondon.
OL,17,FSwain said that despite the "shock" of
OL,18,Fthe diagnosis, he had been "wonderful
OL,19,Fand explained everything really, really
OL,20,Fclearly", and a successful surgery had
OL,21,Ffollowed.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
