OL,3,GNEWSAArtist honoured her surgeon with
OL,4,Ahis portrait
OL,5,
OL,6,FNow, almost 15 years since being
OL,7,Fcancer-free, she has donated her
OL,8,Fportrait of Gui to the hospital, which
OL,9,Fhe described as "magnificent".
